{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "You know, I thought the dance a bit conscious tonight, for the first time.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["You", " know", ",", " I", " thought", " the", " dance", " a", " bit", " conscious", " tonight", ",", " for", " the", " first", " time", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Hilda was very nice to him, and he sat on the edge of his chair, flushed with his conversational efforts and moving his chin about nervously over his high collar.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["H", "ilda", " was", " very", " nice", " to", " him", ",", " and", " he", " sat", " on", " the", " edge", " of", " his", " chair", ",", " flushed", " with", " his", " convers", "ational", " efforts", " and", " moving", " his", " chin", " about", " nerv", "ously", " over", " his", " high", " collar", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "They asked him to come to see them in Chelsea, and they spoke very tenderly of Hilda.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["They", " asked", " him", " to", " come", " to", " see", " them", " in", " Chelsea", ",", " and", " they", " spoke", " very", " tender", "ly", " of", " H", "ilda", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Alexander leaned forward and warmed his hands before the blaze.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Alexander", " leaned", " forward", " and", " warmed", " his", " hands", " before", " the", " blaze", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Weren't you happy then at all?", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["W", "eren", "'t", " you", " happy", " then", " at", " all", "?"], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "It is such a noble ambition that it is a pity it has usually such a shallow foundation.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["It", " is", " such", " a", " noble", " ambition", " that", " it", " is", " a", " pity", " it", " has", " usually", " such", " a", " shallow", " foundation", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Oh, very well,\" said Gringo, turning away with a shade of contempt. \"You'll find, if you are going into literature and newspaper work, that you can't afford a conscience like that.\"", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Oh", ",", " very", " well", ",\"", " said", " Gr", "ingo", ",", " turning", " away", " with", " a", " shade", " of", " contempt", ".", " \"", "You", "'ll", " find", ",", " if", " you", " are", " going", " into", " literature", " and", " newspaper", " work", ",", " that", " you", " can", "'t", " afford", " a", " conscience", " like", " that", ".\""], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "I have nothing to wear,\" replied that demure person.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["I", " have", " nothing", " to", " wear", ",\"", " replied", " that", " dem", "ure", " person", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "She makes effort after effort, trembling with eagerness, and when she fails to reproduce what she sees, she works herself into a frenzy of grief and disappointment.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["She", " makes", " effort", " after", " effort", ",", " trembling", " with", " eag", "erness", ",", " and", " when", " she", " fails", " to", " reproduce", " what", " she", " sees", ",", " she", " works", " herself", " into", " a", " frenzy", " of", " grief", " and", " disappointment", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Next came Olive's turn to help in the ceremonies.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Next", " came", " Olive", "'s", " turn", " to", " help", " in", " the", " ceremonies", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
